# Route: guide 39 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 38 quests, 1.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris, Feralas, The Barrens, Durotar): Gadgetzan -> Noonshade Ruins
# -> Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan -> Zul'Farrak -> Gadgetzan -> Broken
# Pillar -> Gadgetzan -> Camp Mojache -> Feral Scar Vale -> Camp Mojache ->
# Grimtotem Compound -> Camp Mojache -> ….
#
